                        text "Todo → Doing (nplan start)"
                    }

                    {
                        at 2026-09-02T00:32:35.150317Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @decision
                        text "Operator decision: retire pgorm-cli. Rationale: orphaned since the flattening, still bound to sea-schema/sqlx multi-backend deps, and its migrate surface targets an API (down/fresh/refresh/reset) the up-only runner deliberately dropped. Entity generation remains available as a library (pgorm-codegen). The already-fixed migration template moves to pgorm-migration/template/ as a copy-paste starting shape rather than dying with the crate. Rejected: revive-minimal (no operator appetite for maintaining a CLI surface)."
                    }

                    {
                        at 2026-09-02T00:33:17.849875Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
